# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DeepSeek Harness standalone desktop build - repository ignore rules
#
# Policy: keep the whole working tree in version control (dist/, runtime/,
# src/ included) and only push aside the artifacts GitHub cannot accept.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- GitHub hard limit: no file above 100 MB survives a push ----------------
# These four are also byte-for-byte duplicates of content that IS tracked,
# or are reproducible from it, so nothing unique is lost:
#
#   app/node_modules/electron/dist/electron.exe   235 MB  -> npm install
#   dist/win-unpacked/DeepSeek Harness.exe        235 MB  -> == that Electron runtime
#   dist/DeepSeek-Harness-Setup-0.1.6.exe         142 MB  -> GitHub Releases
#   dist/DeepSeek-Harness-Portable-0.1.6-x64.exe  142 MB  -> GitHub Releases
#
# All four ship as release assets instead (see README, "下载成品").
dist/*.exe
dist/win-unpacked/*.exe
app/node_modules/electron/dist/electron.exe
app/node_modules/electron/dist/*.exe

# NSIS delta-update sidecar for the installer; meaningless without the .exe.
dist/*.exe.blockmap

# --- Installed build dependencies (restored by `npm install`) ---------------
# Anchored to the project root on purpose: runtime/node_modules IS the shipped
# dsh dependency tree and must stay in the repository.
/app/node_modules/

# --- Build scratch space ----------------------------------------------------
app/dist/
dist/*.7z
dist/*-unpacked.tmp/

# --- Local shell state and consumer runtime data ----------------------------
# Credentials never belong in a repository. The desktop shell reads them from
# %USERPROFILE%\.dsh\.credentials.yaml at runtime, or from DEEPSEEK_API_KEY.
.credentials.yaml
**/.credentials.yaml
.dsh/
settings.json
prompt-patch.yml
shell.log
*.log

# --- Locally unpacked toolchain (portable MinGit used to publish this repo) --
# Downloaded from the npmmirror git-for-windows binary mirror; not part of the
# project and not distributable from here.
tools/git/

# --- Smoke-test / screenshot scratch output ---------------------------------
smoke.png
*-shot.png

# --- Editor and OS noise ----------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
